            "role": "user",
            "content": "Dear Ms Keller,\n\nThank you for working with Elm Street Consulting. This letter is our invoice, reference ES-204, for the\nwork delivered on the third of March 2024. We ran two workshops at twelve hundred euros each, and travel\ncame to three hundred and forty euros on top. That brings the total to two thousand seven hundred and\nforty euros. We ask for payment within thirty days.\n\nKind regards,\nTom Elm\n"
